WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.120
Speaker 1: Let's start today with the US-Mexico&nbsp;
border. No matter how many times the right wingers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:11.880
say it. The US-Mexico border is not open under Joe&nbsp;
Biden. Now, you might be saying, David, of course&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:16.920
it's not open. How could anyone believe that&nbsp;
it is open? There are millions of people based&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:24.060
on polling that believe the border is open under&nbsp;
Joe Biden as a result of some change or series of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:29.400
changes that were put in place when Donald Trump&nbsp;
left and when Joe Biden became the president of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:34.440
the United States. This is not true. And we're&nbsp;
going to look at it right now. And the reason&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:40.380
we're going to look at it is it's good to once get&nbsp;
everything on the record so that in the future,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.380 --> 00:00:45.180
when this talking point comes up, when the MAGA&nbsp;
people call me on the Friday show and they say,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.180 --> 00:00:50.100
but the border is open, that's one of the problems&nbsp;
I have with Joe Biden. We can now create a record,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:56.760
a reference point to go through the various&nbsp;
elements of this because this is a I would call it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.760 --> 00:01:04.560
relatively common assertion perpetuated by right&nbsp;
wing media, by right wing politicians. And it is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:12.720
flowing down to just random right wing voters.&nbsp;
The claims are numerous. One of the claims that's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:19.440
often used to say the border is open is you will&nbsp;
hear things like We are catching so many people at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:27.240
the border because Biden opened it. By definition,&nbsp;
if we are catching people, if we are stopping&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:27.240 --> 00:01:35.160
people, if we are taking people into custody, by&nbsp;
definition, the border is not open. Now, when you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:35.160 --> 00:01:42.300
want to look at has policy changed, have numbers&nbsp;
changed, is there something tangible maybe with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:50.160
the wall or with border agents that Joe Biden has&nbsp;
changed? You find that very little has actually&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:50.160 --> 00:01:58.140
changed. The Biden administration has increased&nbsp;
the capacity of shelters and processing centers at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:58.140 --> 00:02:04.200
the border to better manage the flow of migrants.&nbsp;
But that's not evidence of an open border. It's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:11.160
evidence of being able to more quickly and more&nbsp;
efficiently say who is merely crossing illegally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:11.160 --> 00:02:18.540
and needs to be put into sort of the deportation&nbsp;
flow and who is seeking asylum and needs to be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:18.540 --> 00:02:26.520
put into that bureaucratic process. Neither of&nbsp;
those are evidence that the border is open. In&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:31.560
addition to that, there are border security&nbsp;
claims. Biden demolished border security.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:32.340 --> 00:02:40.680
There's no evidence of that. And you can find each&nbsp;
aspect of this widely documented by the relevant&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.680 --> 00:02:48.540
agencies. Funding requests for Customs and Border&nbsp;
Protection under Biden are almost identical to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:53.160
under Trump when it comes to how much money is&nbsp;
being requested by the respective administrations&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:53.160 --> 00:03:00.420
for border security in general staffing levels.&nbsp;
And you say, Oh, well, Trump had way more Border&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.420 --> 00:03:07.020
Patrol than Biden. That's absolutely not the case.&nbsp;
U.S. Border Patrol staffing levels were slightly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:13.560
higher under Obama, around 21,000 total.&nbsp;
Under Trump, they were in the 19,000 range,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:19.860
plus or minus a few hundred border agents under&nbsp;
Biden. They're in that same 19,000 range plus or&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:19.860 --> 00:03:27.300
plus or minus a few hundred. So staffing levels,&nbsp;
identical funding requests, essentially identical.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:33.540
Beyond that, what about policy? What about&nbsp;
policy on turning people around or taking asylum&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:37.920
requests or whatever the case may be? Border&nbsp;
authorities, you may be shocked to hear under&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:37.920 --> 00:03:45.180
Biden are enforcing immigration laws just like&nbsp;
under Trump. Immigrants continue to be expelled,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:45.180 --> 00:03:50.700
detained or allowed in based on the same&nbsp;
standard as to whether they are passing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.700 --> 00:03:55.800
initial screenings and what exactly their business&nbsp;
in the United States is. The Biden administration,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:55.800 --> 00:04:03.060
although they did stop construction of the&nbsp;
wall. Few hundred miles of wall. The Biden&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:03.060 --> 00:04:10.080
administration is repairing all existing border&nbsp;
barriers, adding detection technology to make it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:15.540
easier for Border Patrol to identify where do we&nbsp;
need to go? I'm not even telling you these things&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:15.540 --> 00:04:22.380
because I like or dislike them. I'm just telling&nbsp;
you what the truth is about border policy. It is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:22.380 --> 00:04:28.740
absolutely the case that Biden hasn't added any&nbsp;
new barriers, which I think is the right policy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:34.500
because the wall was quite a silly idea. But Joe&nbsp;
Biden is fully funding the repair of existing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:40.680
barriers that were already there. So you have two&nbsp;
groups of people. You have people that are coming&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:46.860
to, quote, sneak in as the traditional illegal&nbsp;
immigration is sort of characterized. And then&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:46.860 --> 00:04:52.500
you have people coming to seek asylum. And then&nbsp;
in addition to that, you do have people who are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:57.300
coming over for work legally or coming over for&nbsp;
work illegally, but then going back to Mexico.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:57.300 --> 00:05:05.460
There's all of these different scenarios. All of&nbsp;
those categories are being handled the same way&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:05.460 --> 00:05:10.200
that they were being handled under Donald Trump.&nbsp;
You can agree with the policy or disagree with it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:15.720
You can say we should have some kind of permanent&nbsp;
status for so-called Dreamers or we should not.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:15.720 --> 00:05:20.040
You can say I like the wall or I don't like the&nbsp;
wall. Fine. Everybody is entitled to that opinion.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:26.040
But in order to really talk about this, we have to&nbsp;
acknowledge that funding hasn't materially changed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:32.040
from Trump to Biden. Border staffing hasn't&nbsp;
materially changed from Trump to Biden. Joe Biden&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:38.100
is repairing existing border barriers. Joe Biden&nbsp;
is funding new detection technology for areas of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:43.200
the border that are that are more remote. And as&nbsp;
far as policy goes, we have the Title 42 thing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:43.740 --> 00:05:46.440
which Trump put in. And then Biden is&nbsp;
looking, getting rid of it, but it's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:46.440 --> 00:05:52.080
not clear whether it will. So there's that.&nbsp;
But beyond that, we have evidence of nothing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:58.320
more than another completely fabricated talking&nbsp;
point. That's the truth. The border is not open

